    - Term: MSG_ARENA_TITLE_REWARD
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Phần thưởng sẽ được trao vào 21:00 (UTC/GMT 0) dựa vào hạng hiện tại trong ngày.
      - Rewards will be awarded at 21:00 (UTC / GMT 0) based on current class for the day.
      - รางวัลจะถูกมอบตอน 21:00 (UTC/GMT 0) ขึ้นอยู่กับอันดับของวันนี้.
      - 獎勵將根據當日排名於21:00（UTC/GMT 0）發放。
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_ARENA_TITLE_SEASON_REWARD
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Phần thưởng sẽ được trao dựa trên thứ hạng của bạn khi mùa giải kết thúc.
      - Rewards will be given out based on your ranking at the end of the season.
      - รางวัลจะถูกมอบขึ้นอยู่กับอันดับของคุณ เมื่อเราดูการแข่งขันเสร็จสิ้น.
      - 賽季結束後將根據您的排名進行發獎
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: MSG_CALL_ALL_STAR_POINT_PER_HOUR_ADD_SCORE
